;	000000000300088427         ;  "<p><b>Hyaluronic Acid Plus</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Hyaluronic Acid Plus at night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While face is still damp, dab a pea-sized amount of YEOUTH Hyaluronic Acid Plus onto skin and allow to absorb. Layer with other preferred YEOUTH serums. Follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer.</p> <p><b>Anti-Aging Moisturizer L22</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Anti-Aging Moisturizer L22 day and night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While skin is still damp, apply a YEOUTH serum or peel. Apply a dime-sized amount of YEOUTH Anti-Aging Moisturizer L22. Allow to absorb, then follow with sunscreen.</p> <p><b>Radiance Eye Gel</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Radiance Eye Gel day and night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While skin is still damp, dab a small amount of YEOUTH Radiance Eye Gel around the eyes and allow to absorb. Layer with other preferred YEOUTH serums. Follow with sunscreen. Avoid direct contact with eyes.</p> <p><b>Vitamin C&E Serum</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Vitamin C&E Serum during the day. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While face is still damp, dab a pea-sized amount of YEOUTH Vitamin C&E Serum onto skin and allow to absorb. Layer with other preferred YEOUTH serums. Follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer.</p> <p><b>Balancing Facial Toner</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner day and night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Keeping eyes closed, spritz face and neck with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While skin is still damp, apply a YEOUTH serum or peel and follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer.</p>    "
;	000000000300088428         ;  "<p><b>Anti-Aging Super Serum</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Anti-Aging Super Serum at night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While face is still damp, dab a pea-sized amount of YEOUTH Anti-Aging Super Serum onto skin and allow to absorb. Layer with other preferred YEOUTH serums. Follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer.</p> <p><b>Neck Firming Cream</b></p> <p>On damp, clean skin, apply a quarter-sized amount to the jawline, neck and décolletage. Allow to absorb into skin.</p> <p><b>Balancing Facial Toner</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner day and night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Keeping eyes closed, spritz face and neck with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While skin is still damp, apply a YEOUTH serum or peel and follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer.</p> <p><b>Day/Night Cream</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Day/Night Cream day and night. Wash face with a YEOUTH facial cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While skin is still damp, apply a YEOUTH serum. Apply a quarter-sized amount of YEOUTH Day/ Night Cream to the face and neck. Allow to absorb.</p> <p><b>Radiance Eye Gel</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Radiance Eye Gel day and night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While skin is still damp, dab a small amount of YEOUTH Radiance Eye Gel around the eyes and allow to absorb. Layer with other preferred YEOUTH serums. Follow with sunscreen. Avoid direct contact with eyes.</p> <p><b>Retinol Serum</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Retinol Serum at night. Apply every other night to determine skin sensitivity, then increase to every night. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While face is still damp, apply a pea-sized amount of YEOUTH Retinol Serum onto skin and allow to absorb. Follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer. Apply sunscreen during the day, as retinol increases skin sensitivity to the sun.</p> <p><b>Vitamin C Facial Cleanser</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Vitamin C Facial Cleanser day and night. Squeeze a dime-sized amount onto moistened fingertips and lather with water. Massage cleanser into skin using circular motions and thoroughly rinse off with warm water. Follow with a YEOUTH facial toner, then a YEOUTH serum or peel. YEOUTH Vitamin C Facial Cleanser is ideal for makeup removal and works with all skin types. Avoid direct contact with eyes. For external use only.</p> <p><b>Vitamin C&E Serum</b></p> <p>Use YEOUTH Vitamin C&E Serum during the day. Wash face with a YEOUTH Facial Cleanser and pat dry. Spritz face with YEOUTH Balancing Facial Toner. While face is still damp, dab a pea-sized amount of YEOUTH Vitamin C&E Serum onto skin and allow to absorb. Layer with other preferred YEOUTH serums. Follow with a YEOUTH Moisturizer.</p>    "
