;	000000000300091248         ;  "<ul>   <li>Fresh water is essential for brewing a great cup of tea. We recommend using      filtered or spring water and a glass, ceramic or stainless steel pot.</li>   <li>Use one tea bag per cup of boiling water. Cover and steep for 3-6 minutes.</li> </ul>    "
