;	000000000300093864         ;  "Use one of the indicator strips to find your starting N-O level. Monitor at regular intervals (daily or weekly). Your goal is to maintain an “optimal” reading over time. <br>  The best time to monitor N-O levels is first thing in the morning, before eating or drinking. Antiseptic mouthwash and antibiotics can also impact accuracy of the results. 1. Wash your hands and gather saliva on fingertip. 2. Place saliva on indicator strip pad DO NOT PUT STRIP IN YOUR MOUTH 3. Compare results to the color chart. Wait 30-60 minutes to use Indicator Strips after consuming SuperBeets Original Apple & Black Cherry, Neo40, and BeetElite.    "
