;	000000000300088053         ;  "<p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - Algal Oil</b><br> Take one (1) capsule with food. </p> <p> <b>Hibiscus Tea</b><br>  <p>TO BREW: Place 1 tea bag in a mug. Add boiling water and steep for 5-7 minutes.</p> <p>TO FLAVOR ENERGY DRINK: Follow the instructions to prepare the Energy Drink. Add tea bag to the mix in the sports bottle. Steep the tea for as long as desired.</p> </p>  <p> <b>Spearmint Tea</b><br>  <p>TO BREW: Place 1 tea bag in a mug. Add boiling water and steep for 5-7 minutes.</p> <p>TO FLAVOR ENERGY DRINK: Follow the instructions to prepare the Energy Drink. Add tea bag to the mix in the sports bottle. Steep the tea for as long as desired.</p> </p>  <p> <b>Spearmint Lemon Tea</b><br>  <p>TO BREW: Place 1 tea bag in a mug. Add boiling water and steep for 5-7 minutes.</p> <p>TO FLAVOR ENERGY DRINK: Follow the instructions to prepare the Energy Drink. Add tea bag to the mix in the sports bottle. Steep the tea for as long as desired.</p> </p>  <p> <b>L-Drink Tropical Berry Flavor</b><br>  <p>1.) Using weight scale, pour contents from this bottle into the large (32 fl oz) bottle provided, until remaining fluid matches your weight. Discard remaining content.</p> <p>2.) Add water to fill the entire 32 oz bottle and mix gently.</p> <p>3.) Drink the 32 fl oz mix throughout the day.</p> </p>  <p> <b>L-Drink Orange Flavor</b><br>  <p>1.) Using weight scale, pour contents from this bottle into the large (32 fl oz) bottle provided, until remaining fluid matches your weight. Discard remaining content.</p> <p>2.) Add water to fill the entire 32 oz bottle and mix gently.</p> <p>3.) Drink the 32 fl oz mix throughout the day.</p> </p>  <p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - NR-1</b><br> Take two (2) capsules with food. </p> <p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - Mushroom Soup Mix</b><br>  <p>Add package content to 1 cup of water. Stir well to mix. You may adjust water volume to your taste.</p> <p>STOVE TOP: Heat gently over medium heat in a saucepan. When boiling cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.</p> <p>MICROWAVE: Uncover and microwave on high for 2 minutes. Stir and wait for 1 minute. Microwave on high for an additional 1 minute. Let stand 1 minute before serving.</p> </p>  <p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Minestrone Soup Mix</b><br>  <p>STOVE TOP: Open the package and pour the contents in a pot. Add 1 ¼ cups of water, stir and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 15 minutes. Set aside for 1 minute before serving.</p> </p>  <p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Minestrone Quinoa Soup Mix</b><br>  <p>STOVE TOP: Open the package and pour the contents in a pot. Add 1 ¼ cups of water, stir and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 15 minutes. Set aside for 1 minute before serving.</p> </p>  <p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Vegetable Soup Mix</b><br>  <p>Add package content to 1 cup of water. Stir well to mix. You may adjust water volume to your taste.</p> <p>STOVE TOP: Heat gently over medium heat in a saucepan. When boiling cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.</p> <p>MICROWAVE: Uncover and microwave on high for 2 minutes. Stir and wait for 1 minute. Microwave on high for an additional 1 minute. Let stand 1 minute before serving.</p> </p>  <p> <b>FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Tomato Soup Mix</b><br>  <p>Add package content to 1 cup of water. Stir well to mix. You may adjust water volume to your taste.</p> <p>STOVE TOP: Heat gently over medium heat in a saucepan. When boiling cook for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.</p> <p>MICROWAVE: Uncover and microwave on high for 2 minutes. Stir and wait for 1 minute. Microwave on high for an additional 1 minute. Let stand 1 minute before serving.</p> </p>    "
;	000000000300104688         ;  "<p>CHICKPEA & LEEKS SOUP MIX<br>Open the package and pour its content into 1 cup (250 mL) of water. For a thinner soup, use 1¼ cups (300 mL) of water. Mix well.<br>MICROWAVE: Using a microwave-safe bowl heat on high for 2 minutes. Wait 1 minute. Stir and microwave for 1 additional minute. Stir before serving.<br>STOVE TOP: In a saucepan bring the soup to a boil then reduce heat and simmer for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.</p> <p>GREEN PEA & CHIVES SOUP MIX<br>Open the package and pour its content into 1 cup (250 mL) of water. For a thinner soup, use 1¼ cups (300 mL) of water. Mix well.<br>MICROWAVE: Using a microwave-safe bowl heat on high for 2 minutes. Wait 1 minute. Stir and microwave for 1 additional minute. Stir before serving.<br>STOVE TOP: In a saucepan bring the soup to a boil then reduce heat and simmer for 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.</p> <p>SPEARMINT HERBAL TEA<br>TO BREW: Place 1 tea bag in a mug. Add boiling water and steep for 5-7 minutes.</p> <p>SPEARMINT LEMON HERBAL TEA<br>TO BREW: Place 1 tea bag in a mug. Add boiling water and steep for 5-7 minutes.</p>    "
